==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 275,000 and increases by 25,000 with each stage.
*5 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*6 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**6 [[Kroxo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

